N0546"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"1大興兵，使王賁攻遼東，虜燕王喜。","content_fanyi":"秦国大规模出兵，派王贲率兵进攻辽东，俘获了燕王姬喜，燕国灭亡。","content_jianti_auto":"1大兴兵，使王贲攻辽东，虏燕王喜。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":539,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d6636c2-db0e-11ef-bff9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"忽諸，言忽然而亡也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"忽诸，言忽然而亡也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8d6636ca-db0e-11ef-859b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":1019,"link_death_year":1086,"link_td_description":"司马光，字君实，号迂叟，通称司马相公，陕州夏县涑水乡（今山西省夏县）人，出生于光州光山（今河南省信阳市光山县），北宋政治家、文学家、史学家。世称涑水先生，因身后追封温国公，又称司马温公。历仕仁宗、英宗、神宗、哲宗四朝，主持编纂了中国历史上第一部编年体通史《资治通鉴》。","link_td_id":"Q10000074","link_td_number_id":6432,"people_name":"光","people_name_jianti_auto":"光","people_xingming":"司马光","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d6636cb-db0e-11ef-9f91-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-226,"link_td_description":"太子丹，姬姓，燕氏，名丹，是战国末年燕王喜的太子。","link_td_id":"Q10002019","link_td_number_id":316672,"people_name":"丹","people_name_jianti_auto":"丹","people_xingming":"姬丹","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8d6636cc-db0e-11ef-b70c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[太子姬丹]"},{"link_td_description":"召公奭，姬姓，名奭，《史记》只说是周朝宗室，《白虎通》、《论衡》、《帝王世纪》认为是周文王的庶子，食邑于召（今陕西岐山西南），谓之召公，又称为周召公、召康公或召伯。又因其受封于燕国，称燕召公。召公奭是后来燕国和召国的始祖。","link_td_id":"Q10000920","link_td_number_id":336653,"people_name":"召公","people_name_jianti_auto":"召公","people_xingming":"姬奭","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8d6636cf-db0e-11ef-87d9-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[姬奭]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","resolved_place_entity_id":69,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d6636cd-db0e-11ef-8cc8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8d6636ce-db0e-11ef-bad6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"秦灭燕之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0547"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"臣光曰：燕丹不勝一朝之忿以犯虎狼之秦，輕慮淺謀，挑怨速禍，使召公之廟不祀忽諸，罪孰大焉！而論者或謂之賢，豈不過哉！","content_fanyi":"臣司马光说：燕国太子丹不能忍受一时的激愤，去冒犯虎狼般的秦国，考虑轻率，谋划浅薄，挑起怨恨，加速招来亡国之祸，使供奉燕国始祖召公的宗庙祭祀忽然中断，罪过没有比这更大的了！而评论的人中有的还称他德才兼备，这难道不是太过分了吗！","content_jianti_auto":"臣光曰：燕丹不胜一朝之忿以犯虎狼之秦，轻虑浅谋，挑怨速祸，使召公之庙不祀忽诸，罪孰大焉！而论者或谓之贤，岂不过哉！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":540,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d6636c8-db0e-11ef-9314-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-226,"link_td_description":"太子丹，姬姓，燕氏，名丹，是战国末年燕王喜的太子。","link_td_id":"Q10002019","link_td_number_id":316672,"people_name":"丹","people_name_jianti_auto":"丹","people_xingming":"太子丹","start_index":90,"tongjian_id":"8d6636d2-db0e-11ef-9f78-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"秦灭燕之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0547"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"夫爲國家者，任官以才，立政以禮，懷民以仁，交鄰以信；是以官得其人，政得其節，百姓懷其德，四鄰親其義。夫如是，則國家安如磐石，熾如焱火，觸之者碎，犯之者焦，雖有強暴之國，尚何足畏哉！丹釋此不爲，顧以萬乘之國，決匹夫之怒，逞盜賊之謀，功隳身戮，社稷爲墟，不亦悲哉！","content_fanyi":"治理国家的君王，依凭才能任命官员，按照礼制确立政策法令，用仁爱安抚百姓，凭借信义结交邻国；这样，官职便能由有才干的人担任，政事得到礼教的节制，百姓感念君王的德行，四邻亲近友善，并信服其信义。如果能做到这些，国家就会像磐石一样安稳，像烈火一样旺盛，触碰它的会被撞得粉碎，侵犯它的会被烧得焦头烂额，即使还有强暴的敌国，又哪里值得畏惧呢！太子丹舍弃这样的治国之道不实行，反而用拥有万辆战车的大国，去发泄匹夫般的私愤，炫耀盗贼式的谋略，最终功名毁坏，自身遭杀戮，江山社稷化作废墟，这难道不令人悲痛吗！","content_jianti_auto":"夫为国家者，任官以才，立政以礼，怀民以仁，交邻以信；是以官得其人，政得其节，百姓怀其德，四邻亲其义。夫如是，则国家安如磐石，炽如焱火，触之者碎，犯之者焦，虽有强暴之国，尚何足畏哉！丹释此不为，顾以万乘之国，决匹夫之怒，逞盗贼之谋，功隳身戮，社稷为墟，不亦悲哉！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":541,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8d6636d0-db0e-11ef-9c27-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復言，謂言必信而可復也。重諾，重然諾也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复言，谓言必信而可复也。重诺，重然诺也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8d66fa29-db0e-11ef-a4db-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"白公勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公胜","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d66fa2b-db0e-11ef-a9f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"白公勝欲報其父讎，不勝其忿，以及其叔父，事見左傳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"白公胜欲报其父雠，不胜其忿，以及其叔父，事见左传。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8d66fa2a-db0e-11ef-a038-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-479,"link_td_description":"白公胜，芈姓，熊氏，名胜，春秋末期楚国大夫，太子建之子，楚平王的孙子，早年因故流奔外国。回楚后，被封于白地（今河南息县东），号白公。后发动“白公之乱”，劫楚惠王，被沈诸梁打败，自缢而死。","link_td_id":"Q10009097","link_td_number_id":521682,"people_name":"白公勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"白公胜","people_xingming":"白公胜","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc4-db0e-11ef-8ff3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","resolved_place_entity_id":130,"start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc5-db0e-11ef-8408-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"夫其膝行、蒲伏，非恭也；復言、重諾，非信也；糜金、散玉，非惠也；刎首、決腹，非勇也。要之，謀不遠而動不義，其楚白公勝之流乎！","content_fanyi":"跪着用膝盖前行，伏地爬行，并不是真正的恭敬；言出必行、看重承诺，并不是真正的守信；过度耗费金钱、散发珠玉，并不是真正的恩惠；自割脖颈、自剖腹部，并不是真正的勇敢。总之，谋虑不长远而行动不合道义，恐怕就是楚国那个为复仇而死的白公胜之流吧！","content_jianti_auto":"夫其膝行、蒲伏，非恭也；复言、重诺，非信也；糜金、散玉，非惠也；刎首、决腹，非勇也。要之，谋不远而动不义，其楚白公胜之流乎！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":542,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8d6636d3-db0e-11ef-b0ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"鄒陽","people_name_jianti_auto":"邹阳","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc8-db0e-11ef-bae2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc9-db0e-11ef-a3da-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8d671fca-db0e-11ef-b871-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcb-db0e-11ef-ad23-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦王","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦王","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcc-db0e-11ef-88fe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcd-db0e-11ef-a170-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8d671fce-db0e-11ef-ae8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢鄒陽曰：荊軻湛七族。應劭曰：荊軻爲燕刺秦王，其族坐之湛沒。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉邹阳曰：荆轲湛七族。应劭曰：荆轲为燕刺秦王，其族坐之湛没。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8d671fc7-db0e-11ef-984b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":133,"source_start_index":123,"source_text":"聶政事見一卷安王五年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bfb1542-db0e-11ef-a3f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"要離","people_name_jianti_auto":"要离","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd0-db0e-11ef-b223-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"吳王","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴王","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd1-db0e-11ef-8a0e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"闔閭","people_name_jianti_auto":"阖闾","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd2-db0e-11ef-8251-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"慶忌","people_name_jianti_auto":"庆忌","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd3-db0e-11ef-9fdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"溫公","people_name_jianti_auto":"温公","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd4-db0e-11ef-be36-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd5-db0e-11ef-879d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":117,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd6-db0e-11ef-a5b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"聶政","people_name_jianti_auto":"聂政","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd7-db0e-11ef-bd85-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"吳","place_name_jianti_auto":"吴","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd8-db0e-11ef-8900-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"關","place_name_jianti_auto":"关","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8d671fd9-db0e-11ef-9a54-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8d671fda-db0e-11ef-8d28-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8d671fdb-db0e-11ef-bcb9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"8d671fdc-db0e-11ef-9369-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8d671fdd-db0e-11ef-854d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"要離，吳人，爲吳王闔閭刺慶忌。言其力不足，譬如蜘蛛之螫毒於人而靡死耳。靡，披靡而死也。爾雅疏：鼅鼄，卽鼄蝥。方言：自關以西，秦、晉之間謂之鼄蝥，趙、魏之間謂之鼅鼄。蛛，音朱；蝥，音矛。靡，溫公揚子註，音如字。康：美爲切，謂糜爛也。余謂康音義俱非。聶政事見一卷安王五年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"要离，吴人，为吴王阖闾刺庆忌。言其力不足，譬如蜘蛛之螫毒于人而靡死耳。靡，披靡而死也。尔雅疏：鼅鼄，即鼄蝥。方言：自关以西，秦、晋之间谓之鼄蝥，赵、魏之间谓之鼅鼄。蛛，音朱；蝥，音矛。靡，温公扬子注，音如字。康：美为切，谓糜烂也。余谓康音义俱非。聂政事见一卷安王五年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8d671fcf-db0e-11ef-ad9c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"吳祕","people_name_jianti_auto":"吴秘","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe2-db0e-11ef-9339-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe3-db0e-11ef-b603-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吳祕曰：荊軻，以君子之道類之則盜爾。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吴秘曰：荆轲，以君子之道类之则盗尔。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe1-db0e-11ef-91f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-227,"link_td_description":"荆轲，战国末期卫国人，著名刺客。也称庆卿、荆卿、庆轲。受燕太子丹之托入刺秦王政，失败被杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000093","link_td_number_id":5854,"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","people_xingming":"荆轲","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe4-db0e-11ef-8898-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-53,"link_death_year":18,"link_td_description":"扬雄，字子云，姓名又作杨雄，蜀郡成都（今四川成都郫都区）人，西汉哲学家、文学家、语言学家。","link_td_id":"Q10000105","link_td_number_id":68672,"people_name":"揚子","people_name_jianti_auto":"扬子","people_xingming":"扬雄","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe5-db0e-11ef-81d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-513,"link_td_description":"要离，春秋时代吴国人，中国古代刺客。受吴王阖闾派遣刺杀了吴王僚之子庆忌。","link_td_id":"Q10004144","link_td_number_id":925596,"people_name":"要離","people_name_jianti_auto":"要离","people_xingming":"要离","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe6-db0e-11ef-9647-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-397,"link_td_description":"聂政，战国轵邑（今日河南省济源市轹城镇）人，是战国时期刺客与音乐家，其事迹主要出自于《史记·刺客列传》。","link_td_id":"Q10009102","link_td_number_id":523601,"people_name":"聶政","people_name_jianti_auto":"聂政","people_xingming":"聂政","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe7-db0e-11ef-a546-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-227,"link_td_description":"荆轲，战国末期卫国人，著名刺客。也称庆卿、荆卿、庆轲。受燕太子丹之托入刺秦王政，失败被杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000093","link_td_number_id":5854,"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","people_xingming":"荆轲","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8d671fea-db0e-11ef-804d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-227,"link_td_description":"荆轲，战国末期卫国人，著名刺客。也称庆卿、荆卿、庆轲。受燕太子丹之托入刺秦王政，失败被杀。","link_td_id":"Q10000093","link_td_number_id":5854,"people_name":"荊軻","people_name_jianti_auto":"荆轲","people_xingming":"荆轲","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8d671feb-db0e-11ef-9620-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"燕","place_name_jianti_auto":"燕","resolved_place_entity_id":69,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe8-db0e-11ef-b64a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","resolved_place_entity_id":18,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8d671fe9-db0e-11ef-a3e4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"秦灭燕之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0547"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"荊軻懷其豢養之私，不顧七族，欲以尺八匕首強燕而弱秦，不亦愚乎！故揚子論之，以要離爲蛛蝥之靡，聶政爲壯士之靡，荊軻爲刺客之靡，皆不可謂之義。又曰：「荊軻，君子盜諸。」善哉！","content_fanyi":"荆轲感怀燕太子姬丹豢养的私恩，竟不顾七族亲属都会受到牵连，想凭一尺八寸的短匕首使燕国强盛、秦国削弱，这难道不是愚蠢至极吗！所以扬雄评论此事说，要离的死属于蜘蛛、毒虫一类，聂政的死属于壮士一类，荆轲的死属于刺客一类，这些人都不能称为义士。扬雄又说：“荆轲，从君子的道德观念来看，不过是个大盗贼罢了。”这话说得多好啊！","content_jianti_auto":"荆轲怀其豢养之私，不顾七族，欲以尺八匕首强燕而弱秦，不亦愚乎！故扬子论之，以要离为蛛蝥之靡，聂政为壮士之靡，荆轲为刺客之靡，皆不可谓之义。又曰：「荆轲，君子盗诸。」善哉！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_referenc